  "details": "Demo: https://youtu.be/Sar2oJUDtJo\n\nTest World: https://vrch.at/pcjmu9v6 (wrld_db0ddff0-497c-448b-9835-c0ba4e0fb0d4&instanceId)\n\n1. Join world with exactly 2 players\n\n2. Set avatar hiding distance to 0 and enable hiding by distance\n\n3. Have non-master player look at master\n\n4. Have master press \"Run All\" on the menu in the world\n\n5. Have non-master observe master for ca. 20 seconds\n\n6. Check if diamond of master increased in height or not\n\nExpected behavior:\n\nHeight of diamond and position of nameplate should be updated due to doubling of master height.\n\nCurrent behavior:\n\nOnly master capsule is being updated, diamond and nameplate stay at the last known value.",
